      "Section": "LinkedIn Marketing API URN Resolution",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-marketing-api-urn-resolution",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Deprecation Notice:\nThe Marketing Version 202510 (Marketing October 2025) will be sunset on October 15, 2026. We recommend that you migrate to the latest versioned APIs to avoid disruptions. For information on all the supported versions, refer to the migrations documentation.\nIf you haven\u2019t yet migrated and have questions, submit a request on the LinkedIn Developer Support Portal.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "LinkedIn Marketing API URN Resolution",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-marketing-api-urn-resolution",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "As an alternative to API Decoration, individual requests can be made to access the corresponding entity associated with a URN. This is useful when additional information about the entity is needed.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
